				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-3167626/project-proposals-1964-011-1974-014#post-3578957</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 26 Aug 2017 10:54:59 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>ksaid</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1484103</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Ooh I love how the second proposal doesn't actually explain the anomalous nature of the artwork. I actually missed it on my first readthrough. For anartists, &quot;bigger on the inside&quot; must be a very standard effect, so Miller doesn't explain it the same way he wouldn't bother to explain how he's going to carve the marble. That's dope.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
